WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.748
Here's your month, every line ranked against you, best match first.

00:00:04.748 --> 00:00:12.199
The number on each line is how well it fits what you told us, out of a hundred: the higher, the better the fit.

00:00:12.199 --> 00:00:15.153
Your top pick is the yellow sign at the top.

00:00:15.853 --> 00:00:18.498
Each line reads like the pack's own page.

00:00:18.498 --> 00:00:21.918
"Bid pack" view shows it the way the pack prints it —

00:00:21.918 --> 00:00:25.402
flight numbers, deadheads, layover cities, day by day.

00:00:25.402 --> 00:00:31.467
"Timeline" lays each trip out from report to release, so you can see how the days really fall.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:39.448
Tap any line to open it. You get its trips, the features that stand out for you, and the whole month on a calendar.

00:00:39.448 --> 00:00:43.690
Tap a day for everything on it — report time, legs, layover, hotel.

00:00:47.907 --> 00:00:50.610
Star a line to keep it on your shortlist.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.115
Tap the X to hide one you'd never bid.

